    <article>
      <h2 class="blog-text-3">In the meantime...</h2>
      <p class="blog-paragraph">You can read what my direct manager had to say about my time at Kaia Health:</p>

      <blockquote class="blog-quote">
        <p class="blog-paragraph">I have had the privilege of working closely with Cristian during his tenure [...] at Kaia Health. Throughout our time together, I have been consistently impressed by his exceptional skills, dedication, and passion for his craft.</p>

        <p class="blog-paragraph">Cristian's expertise in design systems and strategic thinking has been instrumental in advancing our product development efforts. He possesses a keen ability to envision the bigger picture and align design initiatives with the long-term goals of the company.</p>

        <p class="blog-paragraph">Cristian wholeheartedly embraces the challenge of creating inclusive and user-friendly products that cater to all users, regardless of their abilities. His attention to detail and empathy in considering diverse needs result in more thoughtful and meaningful design solutions.</p>

        <p class="blog-paragraph">One of the qualities that stands out most about Cristian is his continuous drive for improvement. He actively seeks feedback, takes it constructively, and consistently strives to refine his design approach. This dedication to growth not only benefits his own professional development but also contributes to the overall productivity and success of our team.</p>

        <p class="blog-paragraph">His collaborative approach has been instrumental in driving the design system forward. By actively involving the product team and stakeholders, and leading workshops and discussions, he fosters a shared vision for the evolution of our design system. His proactive communication and willingness to listen to others' perspectives ensure that the design system remains aligned with our product strategy.</p>

        <p class="blog-paragraph">Cristian's contribution to our team's success has been invaluable, and I have no doubt that his dedication to excellence will continue to make a positive impact in the field of health care as well product design. I wholeheartedly recommend Cristian for any future endeavours, and I am confident he will be a tremendous asset to any organisation he joins.</p>

        <p class="blog-paragraph">It has been a pleasure working alongside Cristian, and I look forward to seeing his continued growth and success in his career.</p>

        <p class="blog-paragraph"><strong>&mdash; <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mrgarriock/">Glenn Garriock</a>, Chief Design Officer @ Kaia Health.</strong></p>
      </blockquote>
    </article>
  </section>

